<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>Narender v. The State (NCT of Delhi), BAIL APPLN. 4050/2026</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Court</th><td>High Court of Delhi, Mini Pushkarna J</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Decided</th><td>3 November 2026</td></tr>
